{"id":"464129684","kind":"article","title":"助记媒介如何帮助读者建立更复杂的理解？","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z7RgD27WGTZmhHEvEeYcZXAZQwPT8QZ6Ee8xQ"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"助记媒介 & 思想工具","date":"2022-02-05","updated":"2022-10-29","votes":13,"comment_count":0,"minutes":2,"chars":751,"keywords":["助记媒介","间隔重复","学习迁移","检索练习","概念理解"],"summary":"文章讨论助记媒介如何从帮助记忆和应用知识，进一步支持分析、评估与创造等复杂理解。作者提出，随着读者掌握基础内容，可逐步增加卡片复杂度，并关注提取练习与迁移学习；他将这种渐进扩展视为值得探索的设计方向。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/464129684","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"TXyny54g\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4rRX3qwSSJRsEkdXKwH2shamgHNeRthrMLiF\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助记媒介</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>帮助读者记住他们读过的东西，这是理解的重要前提（<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zQiumA4k3SXo1GeRVJpsrVaBRETAoyYmSERS\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">深入理解基于详细的基础知识</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>）。我们还利用这些卡片来帮助读者获得概念性的知识：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z6UZP7P4sRNgRKSvNj7tMV5uW6dDhwwbdZCy9\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复记忆系统可用于发展概念性理解</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>。而且我们能做到的不仅仅是单纯的回忆：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z6Y8xDS2AJyE1d34X99y14Sk1A7YCNas5kFjA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助记媒介可以通过简单的应用卡片帮助读者应用他们所学的知识</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup>。那么，顺着<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2o43GMSejBW6vU4axsSTHit8hxaUBJYUTD8Z\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">布鲁姆分类法</a>我们应该如何达到更高的思维水平，以支持更复杂的理解类型呢？相关的早期实验表明，这可能是可行的：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zE8PK4UUAAWK6LEcmr8jja8JdxpUxcf1FUCX\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复记忆系统可用于促进应用、综合和创造</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup>。</p><blockquote data-pid=\"XrETF90y\">译注：布鲁姆的分类法是一个层次结构模型——一种根据六个认知复杂程度对思维进行分类的方法。布鲁姆的模型由六个层次组成，三个较低的层次（记忆、理解和应用）比较高的层次（分析、评估和创造）更基本，见下图。如果学习者已经掌握了更高的水平，那么可以认为他掌握了以下更低的层次。</blockquote><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-2b3121cc34c824787cf892caca039f09\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-2b3121cc34c824787cf892caca039f09_r.jpg\" width=\"483\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"or3p1fkx\">一个角度是关注<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2a8QGPfUmdLCVokLaegNzmaU6ehC58CUtYi\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">提取练习和迁移学习</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-6\"><a href=\"#ref-6\">[6]</a></sup>（例如<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z6MSrv4m23Z41Gwic6ts3i7Hiy63hdNKH8MbZ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助记媒介可以包含卡片来支持近迁移</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-7\"><a href=\"#ref-7\">[7]</a></sup>）。</p><p data-pid=\"EuZDpYPo\">随着时间的推移来增加卡片的复杂性或许是一种解决方案——在读者已经有了牢固的记忆之后再引入综合性的卡片。见<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zvzwYeFU3Au4Ya2uVh2k3BUu8udZB7NSrAdL\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助记媒介可调整为将创制经验逐步展开的形式</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-8\"><a href=\"#ref-8\">[8]</a></sup>。</p><h2 id=\"sec-1\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"FtateOIl\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"459483765\" href=\"#/post/459483765\">助记媒介 (Mnemonic medium)</a></li><li data-pid=\"x6gst6mj\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"464367658\" href=\"#/post/464367658\">助记媒介可调整为将创制经验逐步展开的形式</a></li><li data-pid=\"Ctv5Ndur\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"536670074\" href=\"#/post/536670074\">提取练习和迁移学习</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-2\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"EXe-X8pe\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"I4lEFgcE\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z7RgD27WGTZmhHEvEeYcZXAZQwPT8QZ6Ee8xQ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">How might the mnemonic medium support readers in building more complex understanding? (andymatuschak.org)</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 助记媒介 (Mnemonic medium) <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"459483765\" href=\"#/post/459483765\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 深刻的理解需要详细的基础知识 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"403208725\" href=\"#/post/403208725\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 间隔重复记忆系统可用于发展概念性理解 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"398045447\" href=\"#/post/398045447\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 助记媒介可以通过简单的应用卡片帮助读者应用他们所学的知识 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"412876669\" href=\"#/post/412876669\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-5\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-5\">↩</a> 间隔重复记忆系统可用于促进应用、综合和创造 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"412311494\" href=\"#/post/412311494\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-6\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-6\">↩</a> 提取练习和迁移学习 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"536670074\" href=\"#/post/536670074\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-7\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-7\">↩</a> 助记媒介可以包含一些辅助近迁移的卡片 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"482358178\" href=\"#/post/482358178\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-8\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-8\">↩</a> 助记媒介可调整为将创制经验逐步展开的形式 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"464367658\" href=\"#/post/464367658\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"463926133","title":"情景体验（Enacted experience）","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":20,"minutes":3,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"464367658","title":"助记媒介可调整为将创制经验逐步展开的形式","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":10,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"482358178","title":"助记媒介可以包含卡片来支持近迁移","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":11,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"412876669","title":"助记媒介可以通过简单的应用卡帮助读者应用他们所学的知识","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":12,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"459483765","title":"助记媒介（Mnemonic medium）","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":37,"minutes":6,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[],"rec_answers":[]}